note: bootstrap/protect.vibe — bytecode protection written in Azra.
note: Integrity: HMAC-SHA256 with a build secret detects any tampering.
note: Obfuscation: base64url encoding hides plain JSON at a glance.
note: This raises the bar; it is NOT unbreakable security.

define seal_text with text, secret:
    set mac to hmac_sha256 with secret, text
    set box to empty map
    set key "payload" of box to base64url_encode with text
    set key "mac" of box to mac
    give back box

define unseal_text with box, secret:
    set payload to key "payload" of box
    set text to base64url_decode with payload
    set mac to hmac_sha256 with secret, text
    if mac not_equals key "mac" of box:
        fail with "Azra integrity check failed: bundle was modified"
    give back text
